Route25_SeaCottage_Text_ImBillHelpMeOutPal::
    .string "...Which one am I. Ask the machine.\p"
    .string "It will not say. It was not built\n"
    .string "to say.\p"
    .string "I'm HOLT. I made the storage.\p"
    .string "Two of us went in. It is holding\n"
    .string "both.\p"
    .string "It will hold both forever. That is\n"
    .string "what it is for.\p"
    .string "Help me make it choose.$"

Route25_SeaCottage_Text_ImBillHelpMeOutLady::
    .string "Hiya! I'm a DAEMON… …No I'm not!\p"
    .string "Call me HOLT! I'm a true-blue\n"
    .string "POKéMANIAC!\p"
    .string "Hey! What's with that skeptical\n"
    .string "look?\p"
    .string "I'm not joshing you, lady.\p"
    .string "I screwed up an experiment and got\n"
    .string "combined with a DAEMON!\p"
    .string "So, how about it? Help me out\n"
    .string "here!$"

Route25_SeaCottage_Text_RunCellSeparationOnPC::
    .string "When I am in the chamber, run the\n"
    .string "SEPARATION SYSTEM from my PC.\p"
    .string "It forces a read. The store never\n"
    .string "does that on its own.$"

Route25_SeaCottage_Text_NoPleaseChief::
    .string "No? Then I stay held.\p"
    .string "It does not hurt. That is the part\n"
    .string "I did not expect.$"

Route25_SeaCottage_Text_NoPleaseBeautiful::
    .string "No!?\n"
    .string "Now don't be so cold!\p"
    .string "Come on, you gotta help a guy in\n"
    .string "deep, deep trouble!\p"
    .string "What do you say, beautiful?\n"
    .string "Please?\l"
    .string "Okay?\l"
    .string "All right!$"

Route25_SeaCottage_Text_ThanksBudTakeThis::
    .string "HOLT: It chose.\p"
    .string "I am not sure it chose correctly.\p"
    .string "I am sure it chose.\p"
    .string "Those are not the same thing, and\n"
    .string "I built the machine that cannot\l"
    .string "tell them apart.\p"
    .string "Take this.$"

Route25_SeaCottage_Text_ThanksLadyTakeThis::
    .string "HOLT: Yeehah! Thanks, lady! I owe\n"
    .string "you one!\p"
    .string "So, did you come to see my\n"
    .string "DAEMONS collection?\p"
    .string "You didn't? That's a bummer.\p"
    .string "I've got to thank you… Oh, here,\n"
    .string "maybe this'll do.$"

Route25_SeaCottage_Text_ReceivedSSTicketFromBill::
    .string "{PLAYER} received an S.S. TICKET\n"
    .string "from HOLT.$"

Route25_SeaCottage_Text_YouveGotTooMuchStuff::
    .string "You are carrying too much.$"

Route25_SeaCottage_Text_SSAnnePartyYouGoInstead::
    .string "That ship, the S.S.ANNE, is in\n"
    .string "ARDOR CITY.\p"
    .string "They invited me. I have been in a\n"
    .string "room with no outside for a while.\p"
    .string "You go.$"

Route25_SeaCottage_Text_CheckOutRareMonsOnPC::
    .string "HOLT: Go on. Look at what is in\n"
    .string "the store.\p"
    .string "None of them are running.\p"
    .string "None of them are gone.$"

Route25_SeaCottage_Text_TeleporterIsDisplayed::
    .string "TELEPORTER is displayed on the PC\n"
    .string "monitor.$"

Route25_SeaCottage_Text_InitiatedTeleportersCellSeparator::
    .string "{PLAYER} initiated the TELEPORTER's\n"
    .string "Cell Separator.$"

Route25_SeaCottage_Text_BillsFavoriteMonList::
    .string "HOLT's favorite DAEMON list!$"

Route25_SeaCottage_Text_SeeWhichMon::
    .string "Which DAEMON do you want to see?$"

